83234383137.mp3"},{"id":"0627069A2BC711000183138313033333231","heroId":"218","skinId":"1723","skinName":"星君·亢金","title":"大厅喊话1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"九天何曾远离人间，神仙亦是凡人修成。\n——凡尘劫厄，吾来荡平！","hasText":true,"duration":13.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/218/0627069A2BC711000183138313033333231.mp3"},{"id":"0678869A2BC711000183238323231303731","heroId":"218","skinId":"1723","skinName":"星君·亢金","title":"大厅喊话2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"吾乃亢金龙，东方第二宿，愿佑一方厚土众生！","hasText":true,"duration":13.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/218/0678869A2BC711000183238323231303731.mp3"},{"id":"0651669A2BC711000183939333731323036","heroId":"218","skinId":"1723","skinName":"星君·亢金","title":"大厅喊话3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"画外音：亢金龙，你可知私自下凡乃触犯天规？\n但见苍生无泪，何惧天罚加身！","hasText":true,"duration":13.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/218/0651669A2BC711000183939333731323036.mp3"},{"id":"0678469A2AFB91000183832383135303832","heroId":"218","skinId":"1723","skinName":"星君·亢金","title":"相遇李元芳","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"达摩：咳咳——昔日曾令金龙驼送一受灾富商，世人以讹传讹，成了金龙送财。","hasText":true,"duration":8.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/218/0678469A2AFB91000183832383135303832.mp3"},{"id":"0617069A2AFB81000183935323839373639","heroId":"218","skinId":"1723","skinName":"星君·亢金","title":"相遇李元芳","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"达摩：人间有难，我岂能不救？至于天规…容我回头领罚吧。","hasText":true,"duration":7.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/218/0617069A2AFB81000183935323839373639.mp3"},{"id":"06426648BE4101000183133333333343534","heroId":"218","skinId":"789","skinName":"拳僧","title":"达摩_拳僧_技能语音3-3","category":"技能","seq":3,"text":"顿悟吧！","hasText":true,"duration":1.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/218/06426648BE4101000183133333333343534.mp3"},{"id":"06159692952811000183232303833313531","heroId":"218","skinId":"789","skinName":"拳僧","title":"达摩-拾年声藏贺文","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"十年过去，你可有清晰自己的人生方向？\n没有也无妨，敢于迈出第一步，就已经很了不起了。\n